<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Robert Docherty</strong></td><td>30 May 1872</td><td>31 Aug 1959</td><td>Hamilton, Lanarkshire → Mercer Co., Illinois → Alberta (Red Deer / Lamerton → Alix) → Calgary</td><td><strong>Verified</strong> &mdash; Illinois years + 1912 crossing now confirmed on FamilySearch / Mercer County records; homestead file &amp; 1959 Calgary records still worth pulling</td></tr>
