<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>Elizabeth Annie (McIver) Docherty</strong> <em>(wife)</em></td><td>20 Mar 1919</td><td>28 Apr 1988</td><td>Saltcoats, SK → Alberta → Edmonton</td><td><strong>Verified / Living memory</strong> &mdash; Hebridean McIver/Campbell line; well-documented</td></tr>
