<tr><td>8</td><td><strong>Thomas Cheesman</strong></td><td>4 Nov 1980/81</td><td>&mdash;</td><td>Calgary, Alberta</td><td><strong>Living memory</strong> &mdash; carries Docherty (+ McIver/Campbell/Cameron) via his mother; surname <em>Cheesman</em> chosen, from step-father Brian Cheesman</td></tr>
